{"t":"Rush Wood","s":"rush-wood-e4a54","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Rush_Wood_c1a8fd.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rush Wood</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Rush Wood\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rush_Wood_c1a8fd.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Constructions<br/>Walls</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.6<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">February 18, 2002</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20181224215123&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rush_Wood_Quest_81ce3b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  rush wood.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>When using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Growth%20Rune\">Wild Growth Rune</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It also exists in a lighter color: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rush Wood (Light)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rush_Wood_Light_377b70.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>.\n</p><p>On Open PvP and Retro Open PvP worlds, its color varies depending wether the caster and the viewer are on an active PvP situation or not. On <a href=\"#/wiki/Hardcore%20PvP\">Hardcore PvP</a> and Retro Hardcore PvP worlds it's always dark, whereas on <a href=\"#/wiki/Optional%20PvP\">Optional PvP</a> worlds it will always appear with the lighter color.\n</p><p>It is similar to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall%20%28Object%29\">Magic Wall (Object)</a>, although one can shoot through a wild growth wall and not through a magic wall. They can be destroyed with <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machetes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Machete\">Heavy Machetes</a>, and any of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Secret%20Agent%20Tools\">Secret Agent Tools</a> on all PvP worlds, and by walking over them on <a href=\"#/wiki/Optional%20PvP\">Optional PvP</a> worlds.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>These were not destroyable on PvP worlds before the 2009 Summer Update. The yellow version was implemented with the 10.00 Update and became destructible with the 10.01 Update.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Constructions</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Machete\">Heavy Machete</a></li><li>Kill Stealing</li><li>Living and Dead</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Wall%20%28Object%29\">Magic Wall (Object)</a></li><li>Old Rush Wood</li><li>Remains</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Percht%20Queen\">The Percht Queen</a></li><li>Walls</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wild%20Growth%20Rune\">Wild Growth Rune</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/winterlight-solstice\">Winterlight Solstice</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["winterlight-solstice"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"winterlight-solstice","quest":"Winterlight Solstice","step":"4-2","n":14,"title":"Apanhar ramos","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33721,"y":31056,"z":9,"label":"Local da Rush Wood"}]}]}}